Generic single-database configuration for Alembic migrations.

This directory contains database migration scripts for the Novel Buds application.

Note: `alembic_version.version_num` is `VARCHAR(32)` by default. If you use custom `--rev-id`,
keep the revision id at 32 characters or less (otherwise `alembic upgrade` can fail with
`StringDataRightTruncation`).

## Common Commands

# Create a new migration (auto-generate from model changes)
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"

# Create a blank migration
alembic revision -m "description"

# Apply all pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Downgrade one revision
alembic downgrade -1

# Show current revision
alembic current

# Show migration history
alembic history

# Downgrade to a specific revision
alembic downgrade <revision_id>
